Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:12.36,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The songs you recommended, Mei-senpai, were all truly wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.05,0:00:13.79,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.79,0:00:16.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I knew you'd like them, Tomari.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:17.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Did you see the MV too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:18.96,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:24.80,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}In the past, I would have thought MV production should be left to professionals,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.64,0:00:29.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}but that handmade feel from the members is what makes it great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:32.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}You can really feel the love for the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:37.36,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}And the pride of being school idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.96,0:00:40.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I'm glad you understand, Tomari!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.53,0:00:41.23,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.23,0:00:44.24,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It's rare to see you two getting so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:45.08,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:46.58,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.58,0:00:47.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:48.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Right, Tomari?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:54.56,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Mei-senpai was telling me about some recommended school idols and their songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:56.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Kanon-senpai, it's not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:00:59.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I just thought Tomari might like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:02.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}To me, Kanon is the greatest school idol of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.56,0:01:04.20,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Please believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.52,0:01:05.48,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}U-Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.44,0:01:07.64,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}it's okay, Mei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:09.60,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:13.80,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's the kind of reaction you'd have if you were caught cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:18.32,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Oh, but I'm curious if you two were that excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:21.32,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Tell me about that school idol too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.61,0:01:22.19,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.19,0:01:22.96,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.19,0:01:23.69,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.96,0:01:27.96,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I love the lyrics Kanon-senpai creates from her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.96,0:01:29.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I love her singing voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.56,0:01:34.44,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}The excitement, the worries, the dreams... everything about her is the absolute best, the ultimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.45,0:01:34.95,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.52,0:01:36.64,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}thank you, Mei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:40.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}But this person is quite easily influenced,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.76,0:01:41.90,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}and I'd hate it if Kanon-senpai's unique style changed because she was influenced by other school idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.90,0:01:46.88,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Especially if it was because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:50.52,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Even if it's just a little bit, I'd hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:01:53.88,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I really would.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:01:57.76,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Is it okay for me to be influenced?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.52,0:02:00.92,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}You wouldn't be swayed by something like this, Tomari.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:06.36,Yabushima Akane,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Um, Mei-chan, do you trust Tomari-chan more than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.88,0:02:08.40,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I'm your senior, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.16,0:02:14.12,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Well then, Mei-senpai, let's save that talk for another time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.76,0:02:16.56,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}and get the radio show started.
