Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.04,0:05:56.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}And with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.52,0:06:00.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}some real sweets have appeared from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.60,0:06:02.16,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.56,0:06:03.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}You can actually eat these.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.45,0:06:04.99,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:05.74,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh, they're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:06.56,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.55,0:06:07.05,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.44,0:06:10.17,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I love the sweets from this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:10.69,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.17,0:06:11.67,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.84,0:06:13.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}These sweets seem perfect for Saku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.56,0:06:15.84,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Sakura's little cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:17.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It's just in time for cherry blossom season.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.47,0:06:17.97,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.07,0:06:18.57,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}So many cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.97,0:06:19.47,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:20.17,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.49,0:06:20.99,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:22.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.08,0:06:23.16,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Oh, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.16,0:06:24.44,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I was so surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:30.44,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}So, Saku's birthday is coming up on April 3rd,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.39,0:06:30.89,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.96,0:06:35.28,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}and I know it's sudden, but do you have any goals for this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:36.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I hadn't thought about it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:38.04,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Well, it was a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:39.08,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:41.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Hmm, I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.17,0:06:41.67,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Anything come to mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.24,0:06:42.92,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Anything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.32,0:06:48.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Well, I was just trying to impersonate Sayuri, but it didn't sound like her at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.44,0:06:51.36,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}But I kind of get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.36,0:06:53.32,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}The things you were saying were very similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.44,0:06:54.06,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:54.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.76,0:06:55.38,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.38,0:06:57.26,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Look, everyone is nodding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.26,0:06:57.96,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah, it was similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:06:59.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:02.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It was kind of similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.16,0:07:07.64,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It felt like you were just saying things without much substance, like my energy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.76,0:07:09.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Did the way I spoke sound like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.56,0:07:10.56,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}You captured her traits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:11.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Well, that's good then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.52,0:07:17.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}But I wasn't quite satisfied with myself, so I want to get to know everyone better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.28,0:07:25.32,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I want to make this a year where I communicate more and learn more about all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.11,0:07:26.66,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I'm so happy to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:28.84,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Reflecting on yourself even at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.68,0:07:30.68,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}That's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.32,0:07:32.92,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:39.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Last year, I didn't really get to hang out with the Liella members much in our private time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:44.88,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}so this year, I hope we can make lots of memories together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.01,0:07:45.51,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:46.29,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.35,0:07:46.85,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.41,0:07:47.91,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.72,0:07:51.12,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I got to be the first one to celebrate with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.41,0:07:51.91,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.28,0:07:52.84,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.52,0:07:54.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.56,0:07:55.36,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'm really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.36,0:07:55.92,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.00,0:07:57.40,Yabushima Akane,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.52,0:07:58.92,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:08:02.82,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Well then, we'll be talking about the live shows today too,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:04.60,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}so let's have a fun broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.75,0:08:05.25,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.32,0:08:08.24,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Everyone, please stay with us until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:14.96,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Love Live! Superstar!! Yui-ga-oka Girls' High School Broadcast Club Lieraji, let's Super Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.56,0:08:22.92,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Love Live! Superstar!! Yui-ga-oka Girls' High School Broadcast Club Lieraji!
Comment: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:30.40,Date Sayuri,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Self-Introductions ===
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:30.40,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Once again, I'm Sakura, also known as Saku-chan, playing the role of Tomari Onitsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:32.64,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'm Tate Sayuri, also known as Saerin, playing the role of Kanon Shibuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:35.32,Yabushima Akane,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}And I'm Yabushima Kano, also known as Yabu-chan, playing the role of Mei Yoneme.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.76,0:08:36.52,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We are
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:38.24,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Liella!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:43.48,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Now, it's time for the Yui-ga-oka Girls' High School Suggestion Box, where we introduce your letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:47.04,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Everyone, all together now. One, two... Suggestion Box!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:49.48,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Let's introduce some mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:50.10,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.10,0:08:53.26,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}This one is from Lieraji name: Rodem-sansei.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:54.12,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.32,0:08:55.40,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.64,0:09:02.56,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"The 7th Live was great overall, but 'Pop Talking' sung by the 2nd gen members was especially memorable."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:09.48,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"It's a bright song, but seeing the four 2nd gen members just messing around felt like a perfect fit."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:13.60,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"It felt like you were all singing freely and having a lot of fun."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.60,0:09:19.26,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"Also, seeing Yabushima-san sobbing while talking about this song during the MC was very moving."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.26,0:09:20.16,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.44,0:09:21.04,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:25.32,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Next is from Lieraji name: Masumasu OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.32,0:09:26.28,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.40,0:09:27.48,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.60,0:09:31.32,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"The 7th Live was the first time I attended every single performance of a tour."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:35.82,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"Even with the same songs, there were different things each time, which was always exciting."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.82,0:09:43.58,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"Especially 'Pop Talking,' where the four 2nd gen members looked like they were having a bright conversation, just like the title. It was the best."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:46.30,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"It was a song that made me feel the bond of the 2nd gen members even more."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.30,0:09:47.08,Date Sayuri,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's what they wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:48.24,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:49.32,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.64,0:09:51.48,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Pop Talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.39,0:09:51.89,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:51.98,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Pop Talk-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.64,0:09:54.24,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}The four-person Pop Talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:09:55.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It was so cute, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.73,0:09:56.23,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.84,0:09:57.72,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}So much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.72,0:09:58.31,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:06.56,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The lyrics keep moving from one person to the next, so the transitions are really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.24,0:10:11.52,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's like, 'Oh, now she's singing, now she's singing!' You don't have enough eyes to keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.52,0:10:15.00,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We've sung it before, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.00,0:10:19.28,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}singing Pop Talking with just the four of us felt so fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.36,0:10:26.98,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Because of that, we were walking side-by-side,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.98,0:10:34.36,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}and we could really look at each other's faces. It felt like the four of us were walking home together after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:39.00,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It really felt like we were just chatting while singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.04,0:10:40.92,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I really felt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.64,0:10:42.44,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I thought so too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.96,0:10:52.94,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's a song, but it's more like a dialogue. I'd end up laughing because of how the person before me sang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.94,0:11:00.72,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Seeing those genuine feelings in the moment turned into words was so much fun to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.72,0:11:05.16,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It felt like we were part of it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.92,0:11:07.48,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It was so fun to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.28,0:11:17.72,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The intro to Pop Talking started with the four of us doing Kinako-chan's 'Tekuteku Biyori' first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:20.24,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We were all in matching outfits too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:23.52,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Everything about it felt kind of magical.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.28,0:11:24.90,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.90,0:11:32.56,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Since we were in matching outfits, it felt like we were really hanging out after club activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.56,0:11:36.58,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We had plans, and then we all gathered to go home together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.58,0:11:41.28,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It felt so much like being high school girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:43.24,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I really thought so too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:44.84,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.56,0:11:46.90,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It was cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.90,0:11:48.08,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It was really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.88,0:11:55.50,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You all looked like you were having so much fun, and you said you really were.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.50,0:11:58.16,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Even backstage, you all seemed so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:00.28,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I kind of wanted to join in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:00.84,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.44,0:12:04.06,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I was a bit jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.06,0:12:06.88,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I want to sing it with all 11 of us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:15.32,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It's a song that really transforms on stage. This time, for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.32,0:12:17.76,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}we added choreography to the chorus. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.36,0:12:19.96,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We didn't have that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:25.50,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We added our own personalities to it, like doing peace signs or blowing kisses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:27.68,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}For me, I did a more 'gyaru' style peace sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.40,0:12:33.92,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We each did peace signs that matched our characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:36.32,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'm not sure if anyone noticed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.12,0:12:39.70,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}but there was a lot of individuality in those details.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:40.68,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Oh, that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:42.60,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That was really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.60,0:12:43.64,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You all looked so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.12,0:12:47.68,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Everyone, please listen to 'Pop Talking' a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:49.12,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.52,0:12:52.28,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Let's keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.28,0:12:54.96,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Next is from Lieraji name: Ka-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.96,0:12:56.16,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.16,0:12:56.88,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:13:00.44,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"I attended Day 2 of the 7th Live in Aichi."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:04.72,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"The song that left the biggest impression on me was 'Sing! Shine! Smile!'"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.52,0:13:15.80,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"Just like the lyrics 'Sing, let's sing together, Smile, connecting our hearts,' singing this together with everyone made the venue feel like one. It was so much fun."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.80,0:13:23.44,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"It reminded me that Liella's music has so much power, and just like the name Yui-ga-oka, we are truly connected through song."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:28.10,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"The 7th Live made me love 'Sing! Shine! Smile!' even more."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.10,0:13:28.78,Date Sayuri,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's what they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.78,0:13:29.84,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:30.76,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.64,0:13:35.04,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}This one is from Lieraji name: Nonokura Nonoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:35.92,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:37.20,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:42.60,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"I heard that the 7th Live was recommended even for first-timers, so I attended my first live on Day 2 in Aichi."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.60,0:13:45.84,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"I attended in person for the first time."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.89,0:13:46.39,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:47.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.20,0:13:53.04,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"I was completely captivated by everyone's charming performance, and the three hours flew by."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.04,0:13:58.76,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"One thing that surprised me was when everyone was encouraged to sing along during 'Sing! Shine! Smile!'"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:03.78,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"At first, I was hesitant, wondering if it was okay to make noise other than the usual calls."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:08.48,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"But the sense of unity from everyone singing the same song was so fresh and pleasant."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.48,0:14:13.54,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"I felt a connection with everyone in the venue, and it became a wonderful memory."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.54,0:14:15.42,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"Great job on the 7th Live."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:16.76,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}"I'll keep supporting you."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.76,0:14:17.86,Date Sayuri,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's what we received.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:18.68,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:20.44,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.72,0:14:27.28,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,It's true, having everyone sing along like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:30.72,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,we haven't really done that much before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.72,0:14:31.84,Default,host,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.84,0:14:36.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,We all thought about this a lot, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:37.10,Default,host,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.72,0:14:42.74,Default,host,0,0,0,,as Nonokura Nonoka-san mentioned, usually...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:48.12,Default,host,0,0,0,,most songs have specific calls like 'Hai! Hai!'
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:55.76,Default,host,0,0,0,,So even with a song like 'Sing! Shine! Smile!' that says 'let's sing together,' people might wonder if it's okay to use their voices,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.76,0:14:58.96,Default,host,0,0,0,,or how loud they should sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.76,0:15:03.12,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I'm sure many people were hesitant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.12,0:15:09.36,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,We actually saw quite a few people like that. But the 7th Live was 'Music World.'
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.36,0:15:19.20,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Liella is a school that values singing and music, and we really wanted to showcase that this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.20,0:15:27.44,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,So we wanted everyone to sing, and we even chose 'Sing! Shine! Smile!' for the double encore on the final day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:34.48,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,The lyrics say 'let's sing together,'
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.48,0:15:37.00,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,and some people had been singing along before,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.88,0:15:44.12,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,but we were so grateful for those who were unsure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.12,0:15:57.56,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,We thought a lot about how to encourage everyone to sing along and show them how fun it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:16:03.00,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,And we wanted to do it without breaking the 'Music World' atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.64,0:16:09.30,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,We put a lot of thought into how to invite everyone to sing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.30,0:16:10.28,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:13.76,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,But everyone really sang along,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.36,0:16:16.16,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,and it made me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:21.98,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,And with each performance, more people realized,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.98,0:16:25.58,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,'Oh, it's okay to sing!'
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:29.88,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,The voices got louder with every show,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:36.00,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,and that growing sense of unity was really wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:44.40,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,When everyone is singing, you can see their sparkling smiles
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:45.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,from the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.52,0:16:48.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,Those smiles are truly beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.60,0:16:54.60,Default,host,0,0,0,,Singing together makes us smile even more too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:57.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,It was so heart-warming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:17:07.64,Default,host,0,0,0,,For this live show, we really wanted to connect our hearts through song more than ever before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.64,0:17:11.36,Default,host,0,0,0,,We all wanted it to be a show where people could really feel that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.88,0:17:16.68,Default,host,0,0,0,,So I'm glad we could include songs where everyone sings together,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.68,0:17:23.38,Default,host,0,0,0,,and I want to have more opportunities like that in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.38,0:17:29.08,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I want to keep increasing the number of songs we can all sing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.72,0:17:36.40,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Lately, Liella has had many songs that are more about 'showing' the performance, like 'Aspire.'
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.40,0:17:40.84,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Or 'Jumping into the New World,' where it's more like 'Whoa!'
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.84,0:17:44.76,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,There wasn't much of a back-and-forth dialogue
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.76,0:17:47.70,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,with the audience during those performances.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.70,0:17:54.50,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,So 'Sing! Shine! Smile!' was a big challenge for us in a good way,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.50,0:17:58.92,Default,listener_mail,0,0,0,,and I was so happy that everyone joined in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.92,0:17:59.43,Default,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.43,0:18:00.04,Default,host,0,0,0,,I felt like...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:02.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I could really feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:03.74,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}We felt it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.74,0:18:04.27,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.20,0:18:10.56,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I'm sure some people were hesitant, wondering if it was really okay to sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.56,0:18:17.92,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}But Sayurin always says 'Please sing along with us' before we start, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.92,0:18:21.76,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Since Kanon-chan says it, when she does,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:26.92,Yabushima Akane,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I hope everyone feels free to sing as much as they want without any pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:27.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.87,0:18:28.37,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.60,0:18:29.12,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.84,0:18:30.64,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It was so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.63,0:18:31.13,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.36,0:18:35.76,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Next is from Lieraji name: Motocross.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.76,0:18:36.72,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.88,0:18:37.84,Yabushima Akane,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.08,0:18:41.52,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"'Orange no Mama de,' which was performed for the first time at the 7th Live, was amazing."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.16,0:18:48.08,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"Putting this song about the sparkle and fleeting nature of youth in the encore was just unfair."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.84,0:18:53.04,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"Especially on the final day, I couldn't even wave my orange penlight,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.04,0:18:55.56,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I was just soaking in that happy moment."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.56,0:18:56.24,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}That's what they wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:18:57.56,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.64,0:18:58.32,Yabushima Akane,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.16,0:19:01.96,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Next is from Lieraji name: Amatta Neji.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.96,0:19:02.96,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.08,0:19:04.00,Yabushima Akane,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.32,0:19:07.22,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"I attended every single performance of the 7th Live."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.22,0:19:07.75,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:08.23,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:11.42,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"'Orange no Mama de' is the perfect song for an encore."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.42,0:19:18.10,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"I couldn't watch the part where everyone gathers to strike the same pose as the jacket cover without crying."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.10,0:19:20.44,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"Thank you for the best youth ever."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.44,0:19:21.14,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}That's what they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.14,0:19:22.16,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:23.44,Yabushima Akane,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.36,0:19:25.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.08,0:19:25.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}'Orange no Mama de.'
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.93,0:19:26.43,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I love it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.23,0:19:27.73,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Everyone loves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.72,0:19:30.76,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}This song is really great, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.87,0:19:31.37,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.88,0:19:42.08,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It's emotional, but it also has parts where we can all get excited together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:43.84,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}The lyrics are wonderful too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.93,0:19:44.43,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.48,0:19:49.70,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}We really worked hard on recreating that jacket photo pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.70,0:19:56.16,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}We adjusted our positions over and over, even by just a tiny bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.16,0:20:01.80,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}The way it looks changes depending on the angle, so we did it many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:12.92,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}We worked with the dance teacher, adjusting things like 'Tomo-chan, a bit more this way' or 'You two, move your faces closer.' We did a lot of fine-tuning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.87,0:20:13.37,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.04,0:20:15.40,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I love that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:25.56,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}The part where we hold hands and then slowly bring them together. No matter how many times I see it, I love it, but it also makes me feel a bit sentimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:20.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.47,0:20:26.21,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.21,0:20:26.95,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.48,0:20:29.08,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:30.20,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}That part is so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.32,0:20:52.10,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It feels like a typical after-school scene, but also like a very special after-school moment for them. The lyrics say 'Let's meet again tomorrow,' and they probably will,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:32.89,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.10,0:21:06.20,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}but you never know for sure. So those words 'See you tomorrow' feel very heavy and precious. It's just a fleeting moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.59,0:20:54.09,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.95,0:20:56.45,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.71,0:21:04.21,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.20,0:21:09.76,Yabushima Akane,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}That's how I felt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:11.12,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:23.12,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I find myself imagining the moment Kanon and the others decided to take that jacket photo. Like, who suggested it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:31.04,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}And who took the photo? Did they set up a timer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.04,0:21:32.36,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thinking about all that was so much fun while we were performing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.84,0:21:48.20,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}This song feels like it's about a 'now' that won't last forever. It's packed with that fleeting sparkle of youth that's unique to school idols and student life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.11,0:21:48.61,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.04,0:21:55.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Our outfits were from 'Aspire' this time, but if they were different, the song might feel different too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.84,0:21:58.84,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}True, like if we were in school uniforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.56,0:22:03.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}If we did it in uniforms, I think I'd actually cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.07,0:22:03.57,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.15,0:22:04.65,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.88,0:22:06.20,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I feel like crying just thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.32,0:22:07.24,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}You looked like you were about to cry just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:10.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}The 'Aspire' outfits helped me keep it together a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.60,0:22:12.44,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}True, they were 'Music' themed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.49,0:22:12.99,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.64,0:22:14.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.40,0:22:15.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It really is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:17.08,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}What if we did it at a real school?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.83,0:22:22.36,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Oh, that would be too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.36,0:22:23.36,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I'd be like a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.87,0:22:24.37,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}What would I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.88,0:22:25.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}You'd be a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.15,0:22:26.65,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.76,0:22:30.96,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I want to do it someday, but part of me also doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.97,0:22:31.47,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.20,0:22:33.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Like, once we do that, it's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.92,0:22:34.42,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.92,0:22:35.52,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}No, we won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.72,0:22:37.52,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}We won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.52,0:22:38.02,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}We won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.04,0:22:38.86,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Right, we won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.86,0:22:39.80,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Because it would be too final.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.93,0:22:42.43,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.37,0:22:42.99,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.99,0:22:44.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}All 11 of us as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.81,0:22:45.33,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.33,0:22:47.16,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It's a song everyone loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.92,0:22:48.44,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}We're so grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.65,0:22:49.15,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.08,0:22:53.24,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Next is from Lieraji name: Romuromu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.24,0:22:54.04,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.16,0:22:55.16,Yabushima Akane,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.52,0:22:57.26,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"Great job on the 7th Live."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.26,0:22:57.93,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.93,0:23:01.32,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"For the first time in my life, I was able to attend every single performance."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.48,0:23:02.08,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.48,0:23:06.80,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"The most memorable part was 'Universe' performed in Aichi."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.36,0:23:13.80,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"The moment the intro started and the 2nd and 3rd gen members waved at me, I couldn't stop crying."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.44,0:23:19.72,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"I was so happy to be able to sing along with Liella and complete the live show together."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.72,0:23:22.72,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"Thank you for the most amazing and happy time."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.32,0:23:27.48,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"I live in Aichi, so I'd be very happy if you came back again."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.48,0:23:28.26,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}That's what they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.26,0:23:29.00,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.32,0:23:30.04,Yabushima Akane,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.48,0:23:33.28,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Next is from Lieraji name: Romatofu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.28,0:23:34.28,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.44,0:23:35.16,Yabushima Akane,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.56,0:23:39.82,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"Great job on all four performances of Liella! 7th Live FLY! Music World."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.82,0:23:40.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.04,0:23:44.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"'Universe' was performed during the encore in Aichi."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.07,0:23:44.57,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.76,0:23:55.44,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"The five 1st gen members used the entire main stage for their performance. I could feel the strength and brilliance as if the universe itself was right there."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:24:02.28,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"The sense of unity with Liella during the 'Woah woah' calls makes me love this song more every time I hear it at a live."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.80,0:24:07.52,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"I want to keep raising my voice with Liella and making more memories together."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.52,0:24:08.28,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}That's what we received.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.28,0:24:09.40,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.52,0:24:10.76,Yabushima Akane,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.16,0:24:11.76,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.92,0:24:12.44,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.56,0:24:13.80,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Everyone's favorite, 'Universe.'
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.20,0:24:15.36,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I love it so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.56,0:24:16.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.79,0:24:17.29,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}So much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.80,0:24:24.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}The cheers were so loud, it was like everyone had been waiting for 'Universe.'
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.94,0:24:24.44,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.44,0:24:24.94,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I totally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.96,0:24:25.98,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Everyone loves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.98,0:24:27.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}We love it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.45,0:24:27.95,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.49,0:24:28.99,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.40,0:24:30.84,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I wonder how long it's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.84,0:24:32.24,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Has it been a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.59,0:24:33.10,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It has.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.10,0:24:33.61,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.68,0:24:34.80,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It feels that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.16,0:24:35.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.67,0:24:36.17,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.00,0:24:43.90,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I was so moved by everyone singing along on the final day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.90,0:24:45.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I even took out my in-ears to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.08,0:24:52.04,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}We extended the 'Woah woah' part at the beginning this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.78,0:24:52.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.28,0:24:52.86,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.00,0:24:56.32,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}And the voices just kept getting louder and louder.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.09,0:24:56.59,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.32,0:24:59.64,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}That feeling was so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.63,0:24:59.13,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.64,0:25:00.18,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.68,0:25:01.96,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Man, that was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.32,0:25:04.84,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}The 2nd and 3rd gen members were singing from the sub-stages too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.12,0:25:05.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}That was a first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.20,0:25:06.92,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}How was it over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.08,0:25:08.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Oh, it was so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.44,0:25:10.12,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}You were so close to the audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.20,0:25:32.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}We were so close! I could see everyone's faces clearly. Some people were shouting 'Woah woah' with so much joy, while others were sobbing while they did it. It almost made me cry too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.52,0:25:35.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It's really amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.28,0:25:51.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Seeing so many people gathered in one place, sharing the same moment, and facing Liella with that much passion...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.48,0:25:55.82,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I feel so grateful, especially when I can be that close to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.55,0:25:56.05,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.82,0:25:56.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.60,0:26:05.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}As you get older, you might not express your emotions as openly, like crying or laughing with all your might,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.32,0:26:16.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}compared to when you were a child. So those precious moments and expressions...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.88,0:26:24.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It makes me so happy to think they trust us enough to throw their emotions at us like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.27,0:26:24.77,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.76,0:26:26.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.65,0:26:27.15,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.36,0:26:27.96,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.32,0:26:28.84,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I want to do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.87,0:26:29.37,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.96,0:26:30.60,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.84,0:26:31.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.30,0:26:31.80,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.80,0:26:32.44,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.04,0:26:34.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Let's do the 'Woah woah' again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.87,0:26:35.37,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.08,0:26:47.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}The 7th Live really had so many moments where we felt like we were creating the songs together with everyone, more than any live before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.99,0:26:47.52,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.52,0:26:48.52,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}There were so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.68,0:26:50.75,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It was so much fun for us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.69,0:26:51.19,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.75,0:26:51.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.48,0:27:00.31,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}We see so many people saying they had a blast, but we really had a great time too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.99,0:27:00.49,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.31,0:27:01.05,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.03,0:27:01.64,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.64,0:27:09.56,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}On Day 1 in Aichi, usually 'Mirai no Oto ga Kikoeru' would come next.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.56,0:27:13.72,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}People who attended the Kanagawa shows probably remembered the setlist
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.72,0:27:20.62,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}and thought 'Mirai no Oto ga Kikoeru' was coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.62,0:27:25.24,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}But I asked, 'Can you all do another "Woah woah" for the next song?'
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.24,0:27:27.42,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}during Day 1 in Aichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.42,0:27:31.60,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Then everyone thought 'Open the Gate' was coming for a third time...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.60,0:27:32.90,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Well, it wasn't exactly a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.90,0:27:43.68,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Many people thought 'Open the Gate' was coming again, but then 'Universe' started.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.68,0:27:50.16,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Doing 'Open the Gate' three times would have been a memory in itself, but this was new.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.16,0:27:51.96,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Doing the same song three times is quite something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.52,0:27:54.12,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.12,0:27:58.54,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}another 'Woah woah' song came from out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.54,0:28:02.68,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}But 'Open the Gate' also has a lot of back-and-forth calls, like Saku said.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.68,0:28:05.34,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It's a song with a lot of interaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.34,0:28:08.44,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I was so happy we had so many songs like that this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.57,0:28:09.29,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.29,0:28:10.52,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.68,0:28:12.12,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I hope we can perform them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.07,0:28:12.57,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.68,0:28:13.20,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.68,0:28:14.92,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.93,0:28:15.43,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.92,0:28:18.24,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Everyone, thank you for all the mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.36,0:28:19.04,Yabushima Akane,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thank you very much.
Comment: 0,0:28:19.52,0:28:22.68,Sakakura Sakura,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Lunchtime Request ===
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.52,0:28:22.68,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Now, let's introduce a Lunchtime Request mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.68,0:28:23.58,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.58,0:28:26.20,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}This is from Lieraji name: Tetsuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.20,0:28:27.00,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.12,0:28:28.04,Yabushima Akane,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.24,0:28:34.60,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"I'd like to request 'Sing! Shine! Smile!' which was sung during the double encore on Day 2 in Aichi."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.51,0:28:35.01,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.32,0:28:41.34,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"I was so happy to sing it with all of you, so I'd love to hear it during lunch."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.34,0:28:42.20,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}"Thank you."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.20,0:28:43.12,Sakakura Sakura,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}That's what we received.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.48,0:28:44.32,Yabushima Akane,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.44,0:28:45.32,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.08,0:28:47.20,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}We just read a letter about it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.44,0:28:52.48,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Right, and for that double encore, I also thought it might be 'Open the Gate.'
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.48,0:28:58.32,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I was like, 'Wait, are we doing "Open the Gate" three times?' but then I heard it was 'Sing! Shine! Smile!'
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.32,0:29:01.04,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I thought, 'Oh, I guess three times is a bit much.'
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.32,0:29:06.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}You never know, we might do it three times someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.36,0:29:06.92,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}That would be intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.20,0:29:12.26,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Well, please listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.26,0:29:14.76,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}'Sing! Shine! Smile!' by Liella!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.60,0:29:18.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Let's sing together
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.60,0:29:23.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Connecting our hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.52,0:29:27.80,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Let's make it shine
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.72,0:29:31.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}The stars of our smiles
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.56,0:29:50.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Even if we could go anywhere in the past or future, I'll surely be here. I'll always cherish this moment with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.84,0:30:02.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Small twinkles, one by one, meeting and adding joy. Getting hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.40,0:30:09.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I learned about friends and the feeling of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.96,0:30:12.78,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I'm dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.78,0:30:22.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I'm just so absorbed that I even forget to sleep. I don't need freedom as I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.75,0:30:24.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.36,0:30:26.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I realized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.64,0:30:35.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Even if a night where nothing can be seen comes, let's try to smile with courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.00,0:30:38.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}That sparkle is sure to reach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.23,0:30:40.94,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.94,0:30:42.44,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Smiles sparkling
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.41,0:30:45.11,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.11,0:30:46.60,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Everyone sparkling
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.08,0:31:13.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I wanted to tell you, so I let my pen glide. It's as if the world is smiling, just like when we first met.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.88,0:31:21.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I feel like I can grab even small glimmers, so I reach out my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.40,0:31:25.72,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Something was funny and I burst out laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.56,0:31:31.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Always, no matter when, it's dazzling.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.32,0:31:40.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I can do more, I can do more. My heart is pounding uncontrollably.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.04,0:31:43.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I won't be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.52,0:31:44.19,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Connecting
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.60,0:31:48.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}The joy, smiles sparkling
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.11,0:31:50.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.84,0:31:52.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Sparkling with you
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.04,0:32:14.20,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}We've been cast under a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.28,0:32:23.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}A spell called a dream. Even as time passes, it won't end.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.52,0:32:28.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It won't be broken until the day it comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.48,0:32:28.98,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.88,0:32:36.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}No one can stop it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.04,0:32:40.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}That's right, we're dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.32,0:32:43.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Because I realized I don't need
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.08,0:32:47.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}freedom as I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.56,0:32:57.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Even if a night where nothing can be seen comes, let's try to smile with courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.92,0:33:02.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}That sparkle is sure to reach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.92,0:33:04.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Smiles sparkling
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.37,0:33:07.09,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.09,0:33:11.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Everyone sparkling, let's sing together
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.32,0:33:19.80,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Connecting our hearts, let's make it shine
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.72,0:33:24.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}The stars of our smiles
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.52,0:33:35.72,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Love Live! Superstar!! Yui-ga-oka Lunchtime Broadcast Club Lieraji!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.80,0:33:43.08,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}News from Love Live! Superstar!! regarding Blu-ray information.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.08,0:33:51.88,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}On Wednesday, June 24th, the 'Love Live! Superstar!! Liella! 1st Generation Live & Special Live Blu-ray Box' will be released.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.68,0:33:56.64,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It includes the Revival Tokyo Day 2 and the Special Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.36,0:34:02.84,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}The bonus footage features behind-the-scenes making-of for both the Revival and Special Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.64,0:34:09.48,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It also includes a cassette tape with live audio of 'Shooting Voice!!' by the 1st gen and 2nd/3rd gen,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.48,0:34:11.20,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}and a cast booklet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.04,0:34:18.80,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Also, those who pre-order at target stores by April 15th will receive a cassette-style acrylic keychain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.48,0:34:27.92,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It's a memorial package where you can enjoy the revival live tracing the 1st gen's journey and the one-night-only special live, so don't forget to pre-order.
Comment: 0,0:34:28.52,0:34:29.96,Sakakura Sakura,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: News from Love Live! Superstar!! ===
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.52,0:34:29.96,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Next, music information.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.76,0:34:36.10,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}The release of the 'Liella! no Musubu Project Mini Album' has been set for Wednesday, July 8th.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.10,0:34:43.64,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It will be released in five versions: Original, Photo, Team Kodomo, Team Sports, and Team Midori.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.64,0:34:50.72,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}The Original, Team Kodomo, Team Sports, and Team Midori versions will feature new illustrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.72,0:34:53.80,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}The Photo version will use newly taken photos of the cast.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.52,0:35:01.44,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It's scheduled to include 4 songs, including one new group song, plus off-vocal versions for a total of 8 tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.00,0:35:10.14,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}As a first-press bonus, the Original and Team versions will include member stickers,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.14,0:35:12.56,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}and the Photo version will include 'purikura' style stickers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.48,0:35:22.52,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}All versions will include a lottery application ticket for the 'Love Live! Series 15th Anniversary Love Live! Fes' Liella! pre-sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.20,0:35:27.70,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Also, as a linked purchase bonus, you'll receive a Liella! sticker book.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.70,0:35:29.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Don't forget to pre-order.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.92,0:35:34.92,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}To celebrate the release of the mini album, a handover event has been decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.64,0:35:39.92,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}The dates are Friday, October 2nd and Friday, October 9th.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.64,0:35:48.36,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Those who pre-order or purchase the mini album at target stores will be invited to the handover event via lottery.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.20,0:35:54.92,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}The performers differ by date, so please check the application requirements before applying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.64,0:35:59.00,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Check the Love Live! Superstar!! official website for details.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.59,0:36:00.09,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Next...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.04,0:36:01.44,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}goods information.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.44,0:36:09.54,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Pre-orders for the 'Birthday Present 5th Season: Wakana Shiki Set' are now open on the official shop, Yui-ga-oka Girls' High School Purchasing Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.54,0:36:20.30,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It features a new illustration of Shiki-chan in her 'Lillian' outfit from her solo song on Liella!'s 3rd album 'ASPIRE,' which was first performed at the 7th Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.30,0:36:28.72,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Pre-orders are open until 11:59 PM today, Tuesday, March 31st, the day of this Lieraji broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.72,0:36:31.36,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}We have the illustration here...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.36,0:36:32.80,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.16,0:36:34.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It suits her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.13,0:36:34.63,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I'm buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.44,0:36:36.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.37,0:36:36.87,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It really suits her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.29,0:36:39.79,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.79,0:36:40.64,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Mei-chan, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.64,0:36:41.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Mei-chan, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.68,0:36:55.48,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It's rare to see her in a dress that shows her legs. I like her in pants too, but this gives a fleeting, girly impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.72,0:36:48.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Ah, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.67,0:36:56.17,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.09,0:36:56.59,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.32,0:36:58.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}What's with that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.14,0:36:58.64,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.64,0:36:59.14,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.92,0:37:00.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I thought it was very 'you.'
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.48,0:37:01.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Mei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.44,0:37:01.96,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}As expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.17,0:37:02.67,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.76,0:37:04.52,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Should I try to express it like Sayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.92,0:37:05.52,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.76,0:37:08.06,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Um, how's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.06,0:37:08.92,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Mei-chan, how's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.24,0:37:09.88,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}What would she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.88,0:37:10.44,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}If it were Sayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.20,0:37:11.76,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}'I love emotional things!'
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.16,0:37:14.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}You only ever say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.64,0:37:16.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}That's all you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.40,0:37:17.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It's accurate, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.24,0:37:18.12,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I'll just say it for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.20,0:37:19.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It's very accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.05,0:37:19.55,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.35,0:37:20.87,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.87,0:37:22.22,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}That's right. Because it's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.22,0:37:23.08,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It's really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.83,0:37:24.33,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.29,0:37:25.79,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.00,0:37:26.68,Sakakura Sakura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}That was the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.75,0:37:27.25,Yabushima Akane,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}The real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.80,0:37:28.72,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.32,0:37:35.80,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}This is a made-to-order item, so only those who pre-order can get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.80,0:37:40.48,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Check the Liella! official X and the Purchasing Department for details.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.28,0:37:44.28,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}News from the Love Live! Series Official Card Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.80,0:37:53.76,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}A 'Loveca Fan Meeting' will be held on Saturday, May 23rd and Sunday, May 24th at TFT Hall 1000 and 500.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.48,0:38:05.08,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The 'Start Deck: Love Live! Superstar!!' and 'Booster Pack: Royal Holiday' releasing on May 30th will be sold early at the event.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.60,0:38:13.08,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}There will also be events and exhibits for those who haven't played Loveca yet, so please come visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.68,0:38:21.00,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Latest info will be on the Loveca official site and X, so stay tuned.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.56,0:38:22.64,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Appearance information.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.64,0:38:27.16,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}'Liella! no Tutorial Season 2' starts on Nippon TV from April 1st.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.16,0:38:31.36,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Time Machine 3-go will continue as the program MCs from Season 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.92,0:38:36.92,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Catch-up streaming will be available on TVer and NTV Tada after the broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.92,0:38:38.56,Date Sayuri,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Don't forget to check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.56,0:38:49.72,Date Sayuri,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}To celebrate the broadcast, 'Love Live! Superstar!! Liella! no Tutorial 2026' will be held on August 1st and 2nd at LaLa Arena TOKYO-BAY.
